implementationPlan.note:
certify.mjs:
- imports LIFECYCLE_CHECKS and LIFECYCLE_BOUNDS;
- BOUNDS = {...BRIDGE_BOUNDS, ...LIFECYCLE_BOUNDS}, and both boundsOf and the native entry validate against it;
- BODY = [core, ...BRIDGE_CHECKS, ...CONTAINMENT_CHECKS, ...LIFECYCLE_CHECKS], then teardown. There is no R13f, per the governor's lane-swap comment;
- the context carries ledgerDir (path.join(workDir,'ledger'), the base ledger's dir) for the recovery child.

Test harness:
- clones the fake guest for any other present VM, because fakeGuest answers only for GUEST;
- CF3 'stuck' now expects cancellation to fail with CERTIFY_CANCEL_VM_NOT_DELETED;
- LC7 sets the bounds at each max one key at a time;
- the LC3 kill log reads the record's phase from disk, which removes the race;
- the LC helpers are compacted so the diff stays at 394 lines.

Full suite: 346 tests, 345 pass, 0 fail, 1 skipped.
